-- National Insurance Law, s 68 — the amount of the allowance.
-- Quotations (`src:N`) are generated from line N of the deposited source.
--
-- WHAT THIS SECTION DOES. (a) The monthly allowance for each child in the parent's count is
-- the basic amount fixed for that child (s 1 "הסכום הבסיסי" (2)(a) or (b), by the child's
-- place). (b) Notwithstanding (a), a child born before 1 June 2003 who is the fourth child in
-- the count gets the (2)(a) amount × 2.24, and the fifth or later the (2)(a) amount × 2.36.
-- (c) A parent paid, for the month, an Income Support benefit or a maintenance payment, and
-- entitled for that month to the allowance for three or more children, gets a supplement of
-- 70% of the (2)(c) amount for the third child and for the fourth child.
--
-- WHAT IS AN INPUT. The three basic amounts in force on the day (`The basic amounts for the
-- child allowance`): the text prints only their 2015 base, and s 1's updating clause is not
-- encoded. The Institute's published figures are in nii-il06-published-figures.l4.
--
-- ROUNDING. Every amount here is before rounding. s 381 leaves rounding to rules the Minister
-- makes (the rounding regulations of 5746-1985, line 4170), which are not in this row's
-- sources. The Institute's published figures for (b) and (c) are the amounts here rounded to
-- a whole shekel; the tests compare them to within one shekel and no closer.

§ `Section 68 — the amount of the allowance`
-- src:820 | סעיף 68 – סכום הקצבה [תיקון: תשס״ב־4, תשס״ב־5, תשס״ב־6, תשס״ג־5, תשס״ג־8, תשס״ג־9, תשס״ג־11, תשס״ג־12, תשס״ד־3, תשס״ד־4, תשס״ד־6, תשס״ו־7, תשס״ט־3, תשע״ג־3, תשע״ו־3]

§§ `68(a), (b) — the allowance for a child at a place in the count`

-- src:821 | (א) קצבת הילדים לחודש בעד כל ילד שבמנין ילדיו של ההורה תהיה בסכום השווה לסכום הבסיסי הקבוע לגביו.
-- src:822 | (ב) על אף הוראות סעיף קטן (א), קצבת הילדים לחודש בעד ילד שנולד לפני יום א׳ בסיון התשס״ג (1 ביוני 2003), והוא הילד הרביעי ואילך שבמנין ילדיו של ההורה, תהיה בסכום כמפורט להלן:
-- src:823 | (1) [note: (נמחקה);]
-- src:824 | (2) לגבי ילד כאמור שהוא הילד הרביעי במניין ילדיו של ההורה – סכום השווה לסכום הבסיסי הקבוע בפסקה (2)(א) שבהגדרה ”הסכום הבסיסי“ כשהוא מוכפל ב־2.24;
-- src:825 | (3) לגבי ילד כאמור שהוא הילד החמישי ואילך במניין ילדיו של ההורה – סכום השווה לסכום הבסיסי הקבוע בפסקה (2)(א) שבהגדרה ”הסכום הבסיסי“ כשהוא מוכפל ב־2.36.
@ref National Insurance Law s 68(b) (source line 822): "ילד שנולד לפני יום א׳ בסיון התשס״ג (1 ביוני 2003)"
GIVETH A DATE
`1 June 2003` MEANS YMD 2003 6 1

@ref National Insurance Law s 68(b) (source line 822)
GIVEN `the child` IS A `A child`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`born before 1 June 2003:` `the child` MEANS
    `the child`'s `date of birth` LESS THAN `1 June 2003`

-- (b) is "notwithstanding (a)", so its arms come first.
@ref National Insurance Law s 68(a), (b) (source lines 821-825); s 1 "הסכום הבסיסי" (2)(a)-(b) (source lines 187-188)
GIVEN `the place` IS A NUMBER
      `the child` IS A `A child`
GIVETH A `The provision that fixes the allowance for a child`
`s 68 — the provision that fixes the allowance for the child at place` `the place` `:` `the child` MEANS
    BRANCH IF `born before 1 June 2003:` `the child` AND `the place` EQUALS   4
           THEN `section 68(b)(2), a fourth child born before 1 June 2003`
           IF `born before 1 June 2003:` `the child` AND `the place` AT LEAST 5
           THEN `section 68(b)(3), a fifth or later child born before 1 June 2003`
           IF `paragraph (2)(a) fixes the basic amount for the child at place` `the place`
           THEN `section 68(a), at the basic amount in paragraph (2)(a) of section 1`
           OTHERWISE `section 68(a), at the basic amount in paragraph (2)(b) of section 1`

-- (a) "an amount equal to the basic amount fixed for him";
-- (b)(2) "the basic amount fixed in paragraph (2)(a) … multiplied by 2.24";
-- (b)(3) "the basic amount fixed in paragraph (2)(a) … multiplied by 2.36".
@ref National Insurance Law s 68(a), (b)(2), (b)(3) (source lines 821, 824, 825)
GIVEN `the provision` IS A `The provision that fixes the allowance for a child`
      `the amounts`   IS A `The basic amounts for the child allowance`
GIVETH A NUMBER
`s 68 — the monthly allowance, before rounding, under` `the provision` `, at` `the amounts` MEANS
    CONSIDER `the provision`
    WHEN `section 68(a), at the basic amount in paragraph (2)(a) of section 1` THEN `the amounts`'s `under paragraph (2)(a)`
    WHEN `section 68(a), at the basic amount in paragraph (2)(b) of section 1` THEN `the amounts`'s `under paragraph (2)(b)`
    WHEN `section 68(b)(2), a fourth child born before 1 June 2003`           THEN `the amounts`'s `under paragraph (2)(a)` TIMES 2.24
    WHEN `section 68(b)(3), a fifth or later child born before 1 June 2003`   THEN `the amounts`'s `under paragraph (2)(a)` TIMES 2.36

